nd </c><00:00:00.960><c>twenty </c><00:00:00.961><c>days </c><00:00:00.962><c>prior </c><00:00:00.963><c>if </c><00:00:00.964><c>the </c><00:00:00.965><c>material  </c><00:00:00.966><c>doesn't </c><00:00:00.967><c>come </c><00:00:00.968><c>in </c><00:00:00.969><c>contact </c><00:00:00.970><c>with </c><00:00:00.971><c>the  </c><00:00:00.972><c>particular </c><00:00:00.973><c>produce </c><00:00:00.974><c>a </c><00:00:00.975><c>reminder </c><00:00:00.976><c>that  </c><00:00:00.977><c>organic </c><00:00:00.978><c>producers </c><00:00:00.979><c>should </c><00:00:00.980><c>always </c><00:00:00.981><c>consult  </c><00:00:00.982><c>their </c><00:00:00.983><c>certification </c><00:00:00.984><c>agents </c><00:00:00.985><c>before  </c><00:00:00.986><c>purchasing </c><00:00:00.987><c>or </c><00:00:00.988><c>using </c><00:00:00.989><c>products </c><00:00:00.990><c>as </c><00:00:00.991><c>well </c><00:00:00.992><c>I  </c><00:00:00.993><c>was </c><00:00:00.994><c>conduct </c><00:00:00.995><c>your </c><00:00:00.996><c>own </c><00:00:00.997><c>in-house </c><00:00:00.998><c>trials  </c><00:00:00.999><c>with </c><00:00:01.000><c>new </c><00:00:01.001><c>materials  </c><00:00:01.002><c>until </c><00:00:01.003><c>next </c><00:00:01.004><c>time  </c><00:00:01.005><c>this </c><00:00:01.006><c>has </c><00:00:01.007><c>been </c><00:00:01.008><c>a </c><00:00:01.009><c>production </c><00:00:01.010><c>of </c><00:00:01.011><c>Cornell  </c><00:00:01.012><c>University </c><00:00:01.013><c>on </c><00:00:01.014><c>the </c><00:00:01.015><c>web </c><00:00:01.016><c>at </c><00:00:01.017><c>Cornell </c><00:00:01.018><c>edu</c>

